      hvec3_new(0, 0, 0x8000000000000010), 10), _r3_br), 0x3FAD1437630EB967,
  "geo_ray_capsule_branch: a subnormal capsule's copy: the exit within an ulp (classic barrel: 10.2 ulp)");
# A zero-length capsule tiny all through is the sphere case of its copy, whose t is multiplied
