# The portal's EPA run in the band is a verdict's (_GA_EPA_VERDICT): mpr_intersect on two
# spheres 1e-8 deep at 1e6, sent to GJK's path, in 310 calls (966 polishing it), and
# gjk_intersect_3d on radius-2 spheres 4e-12 deep, whose portal's polytope proves the
# contact, in 282 (the review's driver: 294, against 750 from integ-snap6, which polished).
# [measured: lane CO2 pcalls.py and q.py, integ-snap6 and this tree; 2026-10-31]
# ⭐ 3.4.0 (lane CO3): GJK asks that portal at round 8, where it holds the origin for certain: 42
# and 40 calls (integ-snap6's own portal: 22 for the first).
# [measured: lane CO3 suites, this tree; lane CO2 pcalls.py, integ-snap6 (the 22); 2026-10-31]
var _cr_p1 = hvec4_new(0x412E848000000000, 0xC13E848000000000, 0x411E848000000000, 0x3FD26BDC57B8FE60);
var _cr_p2 = hvec4_new(0x412E847F1BCD7B46, 0xC13E847FA4D5913E, 0x411E847FAF9FE70A, 0x3FD26F31D1321E3D);
_co4_calls = 0;
